Note on underlying data: This license covers the KnightBase code, schema,
and build pipeline. The consolidated data itself is drawn from multiple
third-party sources with their own terms (Dhaka Stock Exchange public
disclosures, Bangladesh Bank public statistics, World Bank Open Data,
and a Mendeley/Harvard Dataverse historical dataset). See README.md,
"Sources & Attribution" for details on each. Users redistributing the
data itself, rather than the code, should verify the original source's
terms independently.
